{"id": "travel-eval-validation-001", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "45b775a94625e90fd7f97ee66102cc652e6e5c2aa585d2a642571961747b53fc", "prompt_tokens": 411, "generated_tokens": 43, "generation_seconds": 1.8454, "answer": "厦门站更适合前往中山路、沙坡尾、曾厝垵等岛内片区；厦门北站更适合高铁网络转场，但到主要旅游区通常还要继续接驳。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-002", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "0663a467196e2d0dd3049288017348f8d5cae7fc9d3b5078dd74e53892da0644", "prompt_tokens": 402, "generated_tokens": 39, "generation_seconds": 1.7357, "answer": "前往鼓浪屿必须通过轮渡上岛。游客要先到指定码头，再完成船票、候船、乘船和步行入岛等流程。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-003", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "1f3d5489158d69ec104bee1034b34ced7e9bd21f1ae48035a7879e2267e64db3", "prompt_tokens": 402, "generated_tokens": 30, "generation_seconds": 1.3361, "answer": "可以考虑打车，因为厦门岛内各热门片区距离相对可控，所以打车在自由行里很常见[1]。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-004", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "42f53192a98510555eb630a6c7733ea6c2119682f5908643a287a547c309716e", "prompt_tokens": 400, "generated_tokens": 42, "generation_seconds": 1.8589, "answer": "鼓浪屿的核心价值不是某一个地标，而是整座岛的建筑、坡道、小巷、海岛街区氛围和步行体验。它更适合留主要时段慢慢逛。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-005", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "bbe4d53af27526113563b4fdec84fa5ad2e7ff227c676ba9385c94002c0fae5a", "prompt_tokens": 539, "generated_tokens": 30, "generation_seconds": 1.3705, "answer": "沙茶面适合做早餐、午餐或简餐[1]，姜母鸭更适合作为正餐补充[1]。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-006", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "f627953ede8c4a1b1346c6ac39afad41af2609e60b7d0dbcb46d66bb97eab119", "prompt_tokens": 421, "generated_tokens": 35, "generation_seconds": 1.5407, "answer": "鼓浪屿岛上适合慢游、拍照和住一晚体验。它的优势是沉浸感很强，夜晚和清晨的氛围与白天不同。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-007", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "729e670b50b88d279fcf4a46b4eceb5c2748b28b8e4127ff06edd628923706da", "prompt_tokens": 413, "generated_tokens": 36, "generation_seconds": 1.5325, "answer": "环岛路和曾厝垵这一带适合海边休闲和城市慢节奏，更像“住在厦门的生活感”而不是“住在景区门口”[1]。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-008", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "5432528484abd4ac2dcf6e00f0c3af93aa349368a4edb059759c25b8b135dfa5", "prompt_tokens": 503, "generated_tokens": 27, "generation_seconds": 1.1903, "answer": "鼓浪屿更适合边逛边吃，但真正想做系统觅食，还是本岛更完整。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-009", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "fed6eaee3dfcc32ece99c01e7eb83d09cadcabafb6b170900385fa60f539a9d3", "prompt_tokens": 491, "generated_tokens": 65, "generation_seconds": 2.7849, "answer": "适合第一次来厦门、重点玩鼓浪屿和老城的人，推荐住在中山路和轮渡片区。[1]\n\n上岛前要确认鼓浪屿轮渡的码头、航线和班次，建议出发前先确认出发码头、上岛码头和返程码头。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-010", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "bf06088279270f5239a8ea710b56c3fff6c0952f2affa76b04fcdd37ac4234e4", "prompt_tokens": 562, "generated_tokens": 25, "generation_seconds": 1.1263, "answer": "第一天安排老城，第二天鼓浪屿，第三天海边，是符合厦门旅游节奏的。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [2], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-011", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "60bc72c2bfe54e176aa186ca76c4b1ad66e33ce575d19008f17ab858672b1326", "prompt_tokens": 452, "generated_tokens": 104, "generation_seconds": 4.4837, "answer": "厦门城区不自驾，白天玩本岛片区，晚上希望吃饭散步方便，交通和住宿怎么搭配？\n\n交通建议：\n- 岛内活动以中山路、厦大、沙坡尾、曾厝垵、环岛路为主，地铁加网约车的组合通常最灵活[1]。\n- 用餐和夜间活动，中山路和轮渡片区更稳[2]。\n\n住宿建议：\n- 选择中山路、轮渡片区的酒店，方便晚上吃饭散步。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-012", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "270c2f082fa48db6d0f45cf64b9cc6ade5cb2c3cd4a3476ea85e92d5cd293561", "prompt_tokens": 429, "generated_tokens": 31, "generation_seconds": 1.3802, "answer": "如果行李多，可以考虑把行李寄存在鼓浪屿的酒店，或者在岛上找一个可以寄存行李的地方。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [1], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-013", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "7a7be1538a1b0052756ae1dbf04ad54024c1c925f2fb503080e64ca40deb34e8", "prompt_tokens": 443, "generated_tokens": 26, "generation_seconds": 1.1669, "answer": "如果想方便吃喝和上岛，选老城；想要松弛和海边散步，选海边。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [1], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-014", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "constrained_planning", "input_sha256": "a8a864efc7fa62baedf144e5232bd33cedfc31841d7353b74c55a417f34a9946", "prompt_tokens": 450, "generated_tokens": 40, "generation_seconds": 1.7331, "answer": "2 天更适合只保留“本岛老城 + 鼓浪屿”主线 [1]。\n\n如果只有 2 天，环岛路可以缩减 [2]。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
